## The Overlooked Powerhouse of YouTube Shorts

While most brands focus exclusively on TikTok and Meta, YouTube Shorts quietly delivers over **70 billion views every single day** with substantially lower CPMs and higher buyer purchasing power.

Shorts viewers skew slightly older and possess higher discretionary income. Adapt your video pace with informative, utility-driven hooks that explain "How It Works" in clear, digestible steps.
